            "title": "Vanda Pharmaceuticals (VNDA) Is Up 21.3% After Tradipitant Shows Promise in Reducing Wegovy Side Effects",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Vanda Pharmaceuticals recently announced positive topline results from a randomized controlled clinical study showing that tradipitant, an oral neurokinin-1 receptor antagonist, significantly reduced nausea and vomiting caused by GLP-1 agonist Wegovy in overweight and obese adults, while maintaining a favorable safety profile. This outcome highlights tradipitant\u2019s potential to address a major tolerability issue for patients using GLP-1 therapies and sets the stage for Vanda's planned Phase...",
